  "solution": {
    "text": "Let the intensity of sound hear by observer is <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math><br /><math><mn>120</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>10</mn></msub><mo>&#8289;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn></math><br /><math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msq